# Goal: real virtio (or similar) backends without changing the 1.1–1.3 user model.
# Only start when 1.3 is solid.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# Work to land before tagging 1.4.0:
#   W1  virtio-blk (or equivalent) behind the FS protocol — persist beyond ramfs
#   W2  virtio-console or cleaner UART path for the console server (if needed)
#   W3  Smoke: boot from/with block-backed FS or read a file from virtio-blk
#
# Releases:
# 1.4.0   Ramdisk block stand-in on boot path (DISK + read)
# 1.4.1   DRFS image on ramdisk; shell ls/cat serve block text
# 1.4.y   Small block/FS fixes only (virtio-blk proper → 1.6)
#
# Out of scope for 1.4:
#   networking, SMP production, GPU desktop, Linux syscall compat, multi-user login.
# Forward path continues in 1.5+ below (through 2.0).

